{"repositoryId":1105931398,"availability":"available","full":"RookieEnough/Orion-Store","name":"Orion-Store","description":"The ultimate home for Open Source and Cleaned apps. OrionStore offers instant access to YouTube Morphe, YT Music Morphe, and essential open-source tools without the clutter. No servers, no tracking, just a beautiful, modern gateway to the apps you love.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":3641,"forks":118,"created":"2025-11-28T11:15:56Z","updated":"2026-10-14T06:47:21Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://orionstore.pages.dev","topics":[],"demo":"https://orionstore.pages.dev/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T05:07:40.191Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T05:07:40.191Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T05:07:40.191Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-16T05:07:40.191Z","stars":3641,"forks":118}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A transparent app store built around public releases, inspectable metadata, and automation you can actually follow.","Orion Store is an Android-first store client that leans on public sources instead of hiding everything behind a private service layer. The app pulls catalog data from public JSON, resolves releases from GitHub, GitLab, and Codeberg, and keeps the delivery path understandable enough that users can see where things come from and how updates are discovered.","This repository is the client application itself. The live catalog, configuration, notices, and release metadata used by the app are maintained separately in RookieEnough/Orion-Data, which keeps the UI and the store data cleanly separated."],"features":["Public JSON catalog with inspectable configuration","Multi-source releases (GitHub, GitLab, Codeberg)","Native install, update, and security tooling","Skip Android's 24-hour unverified-app wait with built-in wireless install","Release intelligence"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RookieEnough/Orion-Store/